@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam shadowing false
title Explicit Publication - Owning Operation and Recorded Outcome
actor User
participant "Core entry adapter" as Entry
participant "Publication use case / policy" as Service
database "Owner-local persistence" as Store
participant "Owner-local worker" as Worker
User -> Entry : Confirm exact candidate / language / selection
Entry -> Service : Actor + expected version + request identity
Service -> Service : Validate current authority and selected material
alt Denied / invalid / stale
 Service --> Entry : Bounded denial / validation / conflict
else Authorized and consistent
 Service -> Store : Reserve protected material under selected protocol
 Service -> Store : Local transaction: revision + live selection + durable intent
 Store --> Service : Recorded local outcome
 Service --> Entry : Exact recorded publication / processing state
 Worker -> Store : Finalize / reconcile durable effect under owner contract
end
Entry --> User : Truthful operation result; PDF availability separate
note over Entry, Store
Lost response does not prove rollback.
Resolve stable operation identity before unsafe repeat.
end note
@enduml
